      { phrase: 'Cultural homogenization', vn: 'Sự đồng nhất văn hóa', sentence: 'Critics of globalization argue that it leads to cultural homogenization, where unique local traditions are replaced by a standardized, globalized way of life.' },
      { phrase: 'To preserve local customs', vn: 'Bảo tồn các phong tục địa phương', sentence: 'Efforts to preserve local customs, such as traditional weaving or folk songs, are vital for ensuring that these unique aspects of human culture are not lost forever.' },
      { phrase: 'Cultural stereotypes', vn: 'Định kiến văn hóa', sentence: 'Broadcasting diverse stories in the media is one of the most effective ways to challenge harmful cultural stereotypes and promote mutual understanding.' },
      { phrase: 'Intercultural dialogue', vn: 'Đối thoại liên văn hóa', sentence: 'Promoting intercultural dialogue through exchange programs and international conferences is essential for building a more peaceful and tolerant world.' },
      { phrase: 'To reflect cultural identity', vn: 'Phản ánh bản sắc văn hóa', sentence: 'The architecture of a city often reflects its cultural identity, blending historical styles with modern innovations to create a unique sense of place.' },
      { phrase: 'Cultural appropriation', vn: 'Chiếm dụng văn hóa', sentence: 'The debate over cultural appropriation highlights the need for greater respect and understanding when using elements from a culture that is not one\'s own.' },
      { phrase: 'To safeguard intangible heritage', vn: 'Bảo vệ di sản phi vật thể', sentence: 'Safeguarding intangible heritage, such as oral traditions and performing arts, requires active support for the practitioners who keep these traditions alive.' },
      { phrase: 'Cultural shock', vn: 'Sốc văn hóa', sentence: 'Many students who study abroad experience a period of cultural shock, as they adjust to the different social norms and expectations of their host country.' },
      { phrase: 'A melting pot of cultures', vn: 'Nơi giao thoa của các nền văn hóa', sentence: 'Historical trade centers often became a melting pot of cultures, where ideas, languages, and religions from across the globe intermingled and influenced each other.' },
      { phrase: 'To promote cultural awareness', vn: 'Thúc đẩy nhận thức văn hóa', sentence: 'Including lessons on world religions and customs in the school curriculum is an effective way to promote cultural awareness among the younger generation.' },
      { phrase: 'Cross-cultural communication', vn: 'Giao tiếp liên văn hóa', sentence: 'Effective cross-cultural communication is a vital skill in a globalized business world, where misunderstandings can lead to lost opportunities and damaged relationships.' },
      { phrase: 'To uphold traditions', vn: 'Duy trì các truyền thống', sentence: 'While it is important to embrace progress, many communities still strive to uphold traditions that provide them with a sense of continuity and stability.' },
      { phrase: 'The erosion of local languages', vn: 'Sự mai một của các ngôn ngữ địa phương', sentence: 'The erosion of local languages, often caused by the dominance of global languages like English, is a significant loss for human cultural diversity.' },
      { phrase: 'To foster mutual understanding', vn: 'Thúc đẩy sự hiểu biết lẫn nhau', sentence: 'Cultural exchange programs for young people are an investment in a future where mutual understanding replaces prejudice and conflict.' },
      { phrase: 'Indigenous cultures', vn: 'Văn hóa bản địa', sentence: 'Protecting the land rights of indigenous people is often the most important step in ensuring the survival of their unique indigenous cultures.' },
      { phrase: 'To celebrate diversity', vn: 'Tôn vinh sự đa dạng', sentence: 'Public holidays that celebrate diversity, such as Harmony Day, remind us of the value of including and respecting people from all cultural backgrounds.' },
      { phrase: 'Global cultural influence', vn: 'Ảnh hưởng văn hóa toàn cầu', sentence: 'The global cultural influence of certain nations, often through film and music, has a powerful impact on the values and aspirations of people worldwide.' },
      { phrase: 'Traditional crafts and arts', vn: 'Thủ công và nghệ thuật truyền thống', sentence: 'Promoting traditional crafts and arts through tourism can provide local communities with a sustainable source of income while preserving their heritage.' },
      { phrase: 'To bridge cultural gaps', vn: 'Rút ngắn khoảng cách văn hóa', sentence: 'Shared human experiences, such as birth, marriage, and death, provide a common ground that can help bridge cultural gaps even between very different societies.' },
      { phrase: 'Cultural sensitivity', vn: 'Sự nhạy cảm về văn hóa', sentence: 'Training in cultural sensitivity is increasingly important for professionals who work with diverse populations, such as doctors, teachers, and social workers.' },
      { phrase: 'The commercialization of culture', vn: 'Sự thương mại hóa văn hóa', sentence: 'Some argue that the commercialization of culture, where traditions are turned into tourist attractions, risks stripping them of their original meaning and significance.' },
      { phrase: 'To respect cultural differences', vn: 'Tôn trọng sự khác biệt văn hóa', sentence: 'The foundation of a harmonious society is the willingness of all citizens to respect cultural differences while upholding shared national laws.' },
      { phrase: 'Cultural enrichment', vn: 'Sự phong phú về văn hóa', sentence: 'Exposure to a variety of art forms and traditions leads to cultural enrichment, expanding our understanding of the world and our place within it.' },
      { phrase: 'To maintain cultural roots', vn: 'Duy trì gốc rễ văn hóa', sentence: 'For members of the diaspora, maintaining cultural roots through language and food is a way to stay connected to their heritage and ancestors.' },
      { phrase: 'Ancient civilizations', vn: 'Các nền văn minh cổ đại', sentence: 'The study of ancient civilizations provides valuable insights into the origins of our own laws, languages, and technologies.' },
      { phrase: 'To document traditions', vn: 'Ghi lại các truyền thống', sentence: 'Ethnographers work to document traditions that are at risk of disappearing, ensuring that they can be studied and appreciated by future researchers.' },
      { phrase: 'Historical significance', vn: 'Ý nghĩa lịch sử', sentence: 'Sites of great historical significance, such as Stonehenge or the Great Wall of China, must be protected from the negative impacts of mass tourism.' },
      { phrase: 'To promote a sense of pride', vn: 'Thúc đẩy niềm tự hào', sentence: 'Celebrating national achievements in sports or science can promote a sense of pride and unity among citizens from diverse backgrounds.' },
      { phrase: 'Cultural nuances', vn: 'Những sắc thái văn hóa', sentence: 'Translators must be aware of subtle cultural nuances, as a literal translation can sometimes miss the underlying meaning or intent of a message.' },
      { phrase: 'Westernization', vn: 'Sự phương Tây hóa', sentence: 'The process of Westernization has brought many benefits in terms of technology and medicine, but it has also led to the decline of some traditional lifestyles.' },
      { phrase: 'To reflect the zeitgeist', vn: 'Phản ánh tinh thần thời đại', sentence: 'Art and literature often reflect the zeitgeist of a particular era, capturing the hopes, fears, and values of the people living at that time.' },
      { phrase: 'Folklore and mythology', vn: 'Văn học dân gian và thần thoại', sentence: 'The folklore and mythology of a culture provide a fascinating glimpse into how our ancestors made sense of the world around them.' },
      { phrase: 'To influence architectural styles', vn: 'Ảnh hưởng đến phong cách kiến trúc', sentence: 'The migration of people throughout history has led to the blending of different influences that continue to influence architectural styles today.' },
      { phrase: 'Cultural preservation acts', vn: 'Các đạo luật bảo tồn văn hóa', sentence: 'Strong cultural preservation acts are necessary to protect historical buildings and archaeological sites from being destroyed by urban development.' },
      { phrase: 'To foster global citizenship', vn: 'Nuôi dưỡng quyền công dân toàn cầu', sentence: 'An education that includes a focus on world cultures can help foster global citizenship, where individuals feel a sense of responsibility for the world beyond their own borders.' }
    ]
  },
  {
    id: 'media',
    name: 'Media',
    icon: '📺',
    items: [
      { phrase: 'To shape public opinion', vn: 'Định hình dư luận', sentence: 'The media has an immense power to shape public opinion, which places a heavy responsibility on journalists to remain objective and truthful.' },
      { phrase: 'Sensationalist journalism', vn: 'Báo chí giật gân', sentence: 'The rise of sensationalist journalism, which prioritizes shocking headlines over factual accuracy, has led to a decline in public trust in the news media.' },
      { phrase: 'To go viral', vn: 'Trở nên phổ biến nhanh chóng', sentence: 'In the age of social media, a single video can go viral within hours, reaching millions of people and sparking global conversations on important issues.' },
      { phrase: 'Media censorship', vn: 'Sự kiểm duyệt truyền thông', sentence: 'While some argue that media censorship is necessary to protect national security, others believe it is a violation of the fundamental right to freedom of speech.' },
      { phrase: 'Information overload', vn: 'Quá tải thông tin', sentence: 'Constant exposure to news and social media notifications has led to information overload for many, resulting in increased stress and difficulty in focusing on complex tasks.' },
      { phrase: 'To verify the credibility of sources', vn: 'Xác minh độ tin cậy của nguồn tin', sentence: 'With the proliferation of fake news online, it has never been more important for individuals to verify the credibility of sources before sharing information.' },
      { phrase: 'Traditional media vs social media', vn: 'Truyền thông truyền thống và mạng xã hội', sentence: 'The shift from traditional media, like newspapers and TV, to social media has fundamentally changed how we consume information and participate in public debate.' },
      { phrase: 'To target a specific audience', vn: 'Nhắm đến đối tượng khán giả cụ thể', sentence: 'Modern advertising uses sophisticated algorithms to target a specific audience based on their browsing history, interests, and demographic profile.' },
      { phrase: 'Media influence on children', vn: 'Ảnh hưởng của truyền thông lên trẻ em', sentence: 'There is ongoing debate regarding the extent of media influence on children, particularly in relation to the portrayal of violence and unrealistic body images.' },
      { phrase: 'The spread of misinformation', vn: 'Sự lan truyền thông tin sai lệch', sentence: 'Social media platforms have been criticized for their role in the spread of misinformation, which can have serious real-world consequences, such as vaccine hesitancy.' },
      { phrase: 'To uphold journalistic integrity', vn: 'Duy trì sự liêm chính của báo chí', sentence: 'To uphold journalistic integrity, news organizations must ensure that their reporting is independent of political influence or corporate interests.' },
      { phrase: 'Citizen journalism', vn: 'Báo chí công dân', sentence: 'The rise of citizen journalism, where ordinary people report on events using their smartphones, has provided a valuable new perspective on breaking news.' },
      { phrase: 'Mass media outlets', vn: 'Các cơ quan truyền thông đại chúng', sentence: 'Concentrated ownership of mass media outlets by a few large corporations has raised concerns about a lack of diversity in the viewpoints being presented.' },
      { phrase: 'To broadcast live', vn: 'Phát sóng trực tiếp', sentence: 'The ability to broadcast live from anywhere in the world has revolutionized news reporting, allowing for real-time coverage of major events as they unfold.' },
      { phrase: 'Social media algorithms', vn: 'Thuật toán mạng xã hội', sentence: 'Social media algorithms are designed to keep users engaged by showing them content that aligns with their interests, often creating echo chambers.' },
      { phrase: 'To manipulate data', vn: 'Thao túng dữ liệu', sentence: 'The use of AI to manipulate data and create deepfake videos poses a significant threat to the credibility of visual evidence in the digital age.' },
      { phrase: 'Digital advertising', vn: 'Quảng cáo kỹ thuật số', sentence: 'Digital advertising has surpassed traditional forms of marketing, as it allows brands to measure their return on investment with a high degree of precision.' },
      { phrase: 'To provide unbiased coverage', vn: 'Cung cấp thông tin không thiên kiến', sentence: 'Publicly funded broadcasters are often mandated to provide unbiased coverage of political events to ensure a well-informed electorate.' },
      { phrase: 'The erosion of privacy', vn: 'Sự xói mòn quyền riêng tư', sentence: 'The widespread collection of personal data by tech companies for advertising purposes has led to growing concerns about the erosion of privacy in the digital era.' },
      { phrase: 'To promote a brand', vn: 'Quảng bá một thương hiệu', sentence: 'Influencer marketing has become a powerful tool for companies to promote a brand to a younger, tech-savvy audience through trusted voices.' },
      { phrase: 'Information literacy', vn: 'Kỹ năng hiểu biết thông tin', sentence: 'Teaching information literacy in schools is essential for helping students develop the skills they need to navigate the complex modern media landscape.' },
      { phrase: 'To debunk myths', vn: 'Bác bỏ các lầm tưởng', sentence: 'Fact-checking organizations play a crucial role in the digital age by working to debunk myths and clarify the truth behind viral rumors.' },
      { phrase: 'Mainstream media', vn: 'Truyền thông chính thống', sentence: 'While mainstream media still holds considerable influence, many people are turning to independent podcasts and blogs for more niche or alternative viewpoints.' },
      { phrase: 'To launch a campaign', vn: 'Phát động một chiến dịch', sentence: 'Non-profit organizations often use social media to launch a campaign and raise awareness for social or environmental causes with minimal costs.' },
      { phrase: 'Media literacy skills', vn: 'Kỹ năng hiểu biết truyền thông', sentence: 'Possessing strong media literacy skills enables individuals to critically analyze the messages they receive and understand the motivations behind them.' },
      { phrase: 'To generate clicks', vn: 'Tạo ra lượt nhấp chuột', sentence: 'The pressure to generate clicks and advertising revenue can sometimes lead news sites to prioritize sensationalism over quality reporting.' },
      { phrase: 'Real-time updates', vn: 'Cập nhật thời gian thực', sentence: 'Many people now rely on social media platforms for real-time updates during natural disasters or major political events.' },
      { phrase: 'To engage with users', vn: 'Tương tác với người dùng', sentence: 'Interactive content, such as polls and live Q&A sessions, allows brands to engage with users in a way that was never possible with traditional advertising.' },
      { phrase: 'Freedom of the press', vn: 'Tự do báo chí', sentence: 'A free and independent media is essential for a functioning democracy, as it serves as a watchdog to hold those in power accountable.' },
      { phrase: 'To portray an image', vn: 'Khắc họa một hình ảnh', sentence: 'Celebrities often use social media to carefully portray an image that aligns with their personal brand and professional goals.' },
      { phrase: 'Investigative journalism', vn: 'Báo chí điều tra', sentence: 'Investigative journalism requires a significant investment of time and resources, but it is vital for uncovering corruption and social injustices.' },
      { phrase: 'To raise awareness', vn: 'Nâng cao nhận thức', sentence: 'Documentaries can be a powerful medium for raising awareness about complex issues such as human rights abuses or environmental destruction.' },
      { phrase: 'Subscription-based models', vn: 'Mô hình dựa trên thuê bao', sentence: 'Many news organizations are shifting towards subscription-based models to reduce their reliance on advertising revenue and support quality journalism.' },
      { phrase: 'To dominate the headlines', vn: 'Chiếm lĩnh các tiêu đề báo', sentence: 'Major international events, such as the Olympic Games or global summits, tend to dominate the headlines for weeks at a time.' },
      { phrase: 'The digitalization of media', vn: 'Sự số hóa truyền thông', sentence: 'The digitalization of media has led to the decline of print newspapers and the rise of online portals that offer multimedia content.' },
      { phrase: 'To reach a global audience', vn: 'Tiếp cận khán giả toàn cầu', sentence: 'The internet has made it possible for even small-scale creators to reach a global audience with their music, art, or writing.' },
      { phrase: 'User-generated content', vn: 'Nội dung do người dùng tạo ra', sentence: 'Platforms that rely on user-generated content, such as YouTube and TikTok, have democratized the creative process but also created new challenges for moderation.' },
      { phrase: 'To provide a platform for', vn: 'Cung cấp một nền tảng cho', sentence: 'Social media can provide a platform for marginalized voices to be heard, although it can also be used to spread hate speech and harassment.' },
      { phrase: 'Information gatekeepers', vn: 'Những người gác cổng thông tin', sentence: 'In the past, traditional editors acted as information gatekeepers, deciding which stories were important enough to reach the public.' },
      { phrase: 'To foster public debate', vn: 'Thúc đẩy tranh luận công khai', sentence: 'Opinion pieces in reputable newspapers serve to foster public debate by providing a platform for diverse and well-reasoned arguments on controversial issues.' }
    ]
  }
];
---

<div class="collo-body">
    <!-- Header Card -->
    <div class="collo-header-card">
        <div class="header-tag">IELTS Writing & Speaking Library</div>
        <h1 class="header-title">Topic Collocations & <em>Complex Structures</em></h1>
        <p class="header-desc">A curated collection of 320+ high-level phrases across 8 core topics, specifically designed for Band 8-9 candidates.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Sticky Navigation -->
    <nav class="topic-nav">
        <div class="nav-container">
            {topics.map(topic => (
                <a href={`#${topic.id}`} class="nav-link">
                    <span class="nav-icon">{topic.icon}</span>
                    <span class="nav-text">{topic.name}</span>
                </a>
            ))}
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Content Sections -->
    <div class="collo-content">
        {topics.map(topic => (
            <section id={topic.id} class="topic-section">
                <div class="section-head">
                    <span class="section-icon">{topic.icon}</span>
                    <h2 class="section-title">{topic.name}</h2>
                    <div class="item-count">{topic.items.length} Phrases</div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="items-grid">
                    {topic.items.map((item, index) => (
                        <div class="collo-item">
                            <div class="item-top">
                                <span class="item-num">{(index + 1).toString().padStart(2, '0')}</span>
                                <h3 class="item-phrase">{item.phrase}</h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="item-vn">{item.vn}</div>
                            <div class="item-sentence">
                                <span class="sentence-label">Sample (Band 8-9):</span>
                                <p class="sentence-text">{item.sentence}</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </section>
        ))}
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .collo-body {
        --cream: #f8f4ee;
        --paper: #ffffff;
        --ink: #1a1714;
        --ink-soft: #4a4540;
        --ink-muted: #8a837a;
        --rule: #e2ddd8;
        --accent: #c8401a;
        --accent2: #2a5c8a;
        --struct-bg: #f1f5f9;
        --font-display: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        --font-body: 'Be Vietnam Pro', system-ui, sans-serif;
        --font-mono: 'DM Mono', monospace;

        color: var(--ink);
    }

    .collo-header-card {
        background: var(--ink);
        color: var(--cream);
        padding: 4rem 2rem;
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .collo-header-card::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: -20%;
        right: -10%;
        width: 60vw;
        height: 60vw;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(200,64,26,0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .header-tag {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--accent);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .header-title {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
        line-height: 1.1;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .header-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }

    .header-desc {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: rgba(245,240,232,0.7);
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-weight: 300;
    }

    /* Topic Nav */
    .topic-nav {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 100;
        background: rgba(248, 244, 238, 0.95);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
        padding: 0.75rem 0;
    }

    .nav-container {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        overflow-x: auto;
        padding: 0 1rem;
        scrollbar-width: none;
    }

    .nav-container::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

    .nav-link {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 100px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        white-space: nowrap;
        transition: all 0.2s;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
        font-family: var(--font-body);
    }

    .nav-link:hover {
        background: var(--paper);
        border-color: var(--rule);
        color: var(--ink);
    }

    /* Content */
    .collo-content {
        padding: 3rem 0;
    }

    .topic-section {
        margin-bottom: 5rem;
        scroll-margin-top: 100px;
    }

    .section-head {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        padding-bottom: 1rem;
        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    }

    .section-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; }

    .section-title {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        flex: 1;
    }

    .item-count {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        background: var(--paper);
        padding: 4px 12px;
        border-radius: 100px;
        border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    /* Grid */
    .items-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
        gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .collo-item {
        background: var(--paper);
        padding: 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 0;
        border: 1px solid var(--ink);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        transition: transform 0.2s;
    }

    .collo-item:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .item-top {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .item-num {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-weight: 700;
        padding-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    .item-phrase {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.3;
        color: var(--ink);
    }

    .item-vn {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--accent2);
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-style: italic;
    }

    .item-sentence {
        margin-top: auto;
        background: var(--struct-bg);
        padding: 1rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    .sentence-label {
        display: block;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.6rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .sentence-text {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        margin: 0;
        font-weight: 300;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .items-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .collo-header-card { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }
    }
</style>
